      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name comes from Hiram and Anna Pollock, who sold lots along the ridge after their sawmill burned in the 1930s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
