      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Pollock Pines lies at an elevation of 3,980 feet, giving it a mountain climate with snow that can reach up to six feet each year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
